## Technical Details

### Custom Design System (index.css)
The new styling is driven by a centralized `@theme` block in [index.css](file:///d:/E-Voting%20System/src/index.css), featuring:
- **Brand Colors**: Blueprint Blue (`#3b82f6`) and Royal Purple (`#8b5cf6`).
- **Animations**: `animate-float` for badges and `animate-spin-slow` for processing states.
- **Utility Layers**: Simplified layout components like `.glass-card` and `.btn-primary`.

### Clean Codebase
- Removed [App.css](file:///d:/E-Voting%20System/src/App.css) and [global.css](file:///d:/E-Voting%20System/src/styles/global.css).
- Consolidated all imports in [main.tsx](file:///d:/E-Voting%20System/src/main.tsx).
- Refactored all components to use pure Tailwind utility classes.
